00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:58,960
You have developed a very innovative software that can interact with Tibetan language and Tibetan language.
你开发了一款非常创新的软件，可以与藏语进行交互。

189
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:02,960
Can you introduce this software to us?
你能向我们介绍一下这款软件吗？

190
