00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:27,960
so that they can participate in the teaching of Tibetan language with the people.
以便他们能够参与藏语教学，与人们互动。

194
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:34,960
I also came here from the school of learning and learning.
我也是从学校的学习中来到这里的。

195
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:41,960
The biggest difficulty I faced when I was in school was that we didn't have a complete Tibetan language.
我在学校时面临的最大困难是，我们没有完整的藏语教材。

196
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:44,960
Due to the lack of resources,
由于资源匮乏，

197
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:51,960
it caused that all of our students were not familiar with Tibetan culture.
导致我们所有学生都不熟悉藏族文化。

198
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:58,960
We have Tibetan language, but what happened without Tibetan language?
我们有藏语课，但如果没有藏语课会怎样呢？

199
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:04,960
We had a teacher who provided us with Tibetan language during our school days.
我们上学时有一位老师教我们藏语。

200
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:07,960
But the highest grade was in the 3rd grade.
但最高只教到三年级。

201
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:15,960
We had to go to the local library to study in a school.
我们不得不去当地图书馆在学校里学习。

202
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:21,960
There was no teacher who could translate our Tibetan language.
没有老师能翻译我们的藏语。

203
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:25,960
Plus, our teacher couldn't provide us with Tibetan language.
而且，我们的老师也无法提供藏语教学。

204
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:31,960
So we had to listen to the teacher in class.
所以我们只能在课堂上听老师讲。

205
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:35,960
We couldn't read books like ordinary students.
我们无法像普通学生那样阅读书籍。

206
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,460
I understand.
我理解。

207
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:44,960
You want to make the children of the world or the Tibetan family have more books to read.
你想让世界上或藏族家庭的孩子有更多书可读。

208
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,460
Yes.
是的。

209
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:47,960
So you designed a software.
所以你设计了一款软件。

210
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:54,960
This software can translate the books of Tibetan or English and Chinese
这款软件可以翻译藏语、英语和中文的书籍。

211
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:58,960
into Tibetan language.
翻译成藏语。

212
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:00,460
Yes.
是的。

213
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,960
