但我们需要保持质量。

245
00:19:56,960 --> 00:20:03,960
We need to translate the traditional Chinese version.
我们需要翻译中文传统版本。

246
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:06,960
We needed at least two people.
我们至少需要两个人。

247
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:08,960
One was blind and the other was blind.
一个是盲人，另一个也是盲人。

248
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:13,960
We needed 15 days to a month.
我们需要15天到一个月。

249
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:19,960
