我们需要每晚支付5元。

250
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:25,960
But most of the books we wanted to read were over 500 pages.
但我们想读的大多数书都超过500页。

251
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:29,960
So the number of books we wanted was very big.
所以我们想要的书数量很大。

252
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:34,960
But we only needed one person after the software.
但有了软件后，我们只需要一个人。

253
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:38,960
And the time was 15 days to a month.
时间也是15天到一个月。

254
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:41,960
Now we need 10 days.
现在我们需要10天。

255
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:43,960
Most of the books are over 3 days.
大多数书只需要3天。

256
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:48,960
But we need more than 1000 pages.
但我们需要超过一千页。

257
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:52,960
How did she read the books?
她是怎么读这些书的？

258
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:56,960
I don't know.
我不知道。

259
00:20:56,960 --> 00:21:00,960
My university is a Tibetan professional.
我的大学是藏学专业。

260
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:03,960
I know the culture of Tibetan.
我了解藏族文化。

261
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,460
I am a professional.
我是专业人士。

262
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:07,960
I also studied the programming.
我也学习了编程。

263
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:12,960
I combined the logic and the culture of Tibetan.
我将逻辑与藏族文化结合起来。

264
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:16,960
I created a database.
我创建了一个数据库。

265
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:24,960
We can use the words we read on the computer.
我们可以在电脑上使用我们读过的词语。

266
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:27,960
