It can be translated into Tibetan.
它可以翻译成藏语。

273
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:43,960
It means that the book is translated.
这意味着这本书是被翻译过的。

274
00:21:43,960 --> 00:21:45,460
Yes.
是的。

