00:21:44,960 --> 00:21:46,960
You can use the words you read on the computer.
你可以使用你在电脑上读到的那些词。

276
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:48,460
Yes.
是的。

277
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:49,960
This is what you are doing now.
这就是你现在正在做的事。

278
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:52,960
Do you have a listening software?
你有听力软件吗？

279
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:54,460
Yes.
有的。

280
